defaultUnit.description:
Default unit of measure abbreviation. Must match an abbreviation from
[`GET /reference/units`](#tag/ReferenceData/GET/reference/units).
Should correspond to the chosen UnitType — e.g.,
for `Wgt`: `g`, `mg`, `oz`, `lb`, `kg`;
for `Vol`: `ml`, `L`, `Gal`, `fl oz`;
for `Qty`: `qty`.
